<h1 class="h">About me</h1>
<div class="abt-col">
<p class="sans lead">I help companies make better calls about their digital services.</p>
<div class="serif copy">
<p>I have 16 years of experience in digital design, business development and customer experience, with a background in strategic design, brand development, e-commerce and team leadership.</p>
<p>I work where customer needs, business priorities and technology meet. Lately that has meant shaping growth for large Nordic digital services, from availability and delivery to repeat purchases, and helping leadership see where their digital services stand and where to invest next.</p>
<p>I’ve built teams from scratch and helped established ones grow. I’m interested in how teams work: how responsibilities are shared, how customer insight shapes decisions, and how AI becomes a working part of design rather than a topic on a slide. My approach is analytical and pragmatic: understand the wider context, make the trade-offs visible and follow through.</p>
